sequenceDiagram
    participant B as Browser
    participant UI as vss-ui agent adapter<br/>(Next.js, responses connector)
    participant GW as openshell-gateway<br/>127.0.0.1:8080
    participant SUP as Supervisor
    participant WL as Workload (netns none)
    participant AG as Hermes API server<br/>127.0.0.1:18642

    Note over GW,SUP: At sandbox create
    SUP->>GW: dial out over gRPC, the session stays open
    Note over AG: hermes gateway run enrolls the api_server platform<br/>only because the image minted API_SERVER_KEY

    B->>UI: POST /api/agent/runs (same origin)
    UI->>GW: POST /v1/responses<br/>Host: default--#lt;sandbox#gt;.openshell.localhost:8080<br/>Authorization: Bearer API_SERVER_KEY
    Note over GW: route by Host, rewrite Host to 127.0.0.1:18642,<br/>add x-request-id, keep Authorization (bearer-passthrough)
    GW->>SUP: over the open supervisor session
    SUP->>WL: Unix socket on the driver volume
    WL->>AG: connect 127.0.0.1:18642
    AG->>AG: validate bearer, else 401 gateway_auth_failed

    B->>UI: GET /api/agent/runs/#lt;id#gt;/events (SSE)
    AG-->>UI: 200 text/event-stream, response.created
    loop until the run ends
        AG-->>UI: response.output_text.delta
        UI-->>B: SSE event
    end
    AG-->>UI: response.completed
    UI-->>B: final SSE event

    Note over UI,AG: Response bytes retrace the same path:<br/>Hermes to workload to supervisor to gateway to adapter
